The rule engine's architecture was informed by reading (not copying) the
analysis logic of aternosorg/mclogs and aternosorg/codex-minecraft. The
diagnostic rules in mcd/rules/builtin/ are original work by this project's
contributors and target failure modes those projects do not cover.
